<title>MALAYSIA: Hong Leong Properties 6-mth net up 92 pct.</title>
<headline>Hong Leong Properties 6-mth net up 92 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)     11.61    vs	 6.06</p>
<p>    Net profit		 81.35    vs	42.44</p>
<p>    Turnover		  340.52    vs     232.81</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  100.80    vs	61.33</p>
<p>    Minorities	 add    1.74    vs less  0.24</p>
<p>    Dividend   (pct)	  5.0     vs	nil</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is Hong Leong Properties Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
